# MD164 (MD160's steer.pad, unchanged): steer at speed. Gas straight from the Rocksbury spawn (throttle.csv: about 51 ft/s by row 80,
# the collider at row 162 not yet reached), then full right, full left, half right, straight.
sleep 15t
down cross
sleep 75t
stick l 1 0
sleep 30t
stick l -1 0
sleep 45t
stick l 0.5 0
sleep 30t
stick l 0 0
sleep 60t
release
sleep 30t
